== Explanations

#sol-item(1, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Emotional distress and help-seeking relate to mental wellbeing.]

#sol-item(2, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Protective factors can reduce risk, not guarantee immunity.]

#sol-item(3, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[CDC notes that sanitizer may be less effective on visibly dirty or greasy hands.]

#sol-item(4, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Iron is important for haemoglobin formation.]

#sol-item(5, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Five multiplied by four gives twenty grams.]

#sol-item(6, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Dietary patterns, needs, access and context all matter.]

#sol-item(7, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Medicines and doses should be selected for the individual with appropriate advice.]

#sol-item(8, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Counselling and individual professional advice can support tobacco cessation.]

#sol-item(9, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Treatment and support should consider individual needs and avoid stigma.]

#sol-item(10, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Boiling does not remove all chemicals; follow local advice and use safe water.]

#sol-item(11, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[A count or label alone does not establish practical access.]

#sol-item(12, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Sharps can cause injury and infection exposure and should be handled by appropriate services.]

#sol-item(13, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Plasmodium parasites cause malaria; infected female Anopheles mosquitoes are common vectors.]

#sol-item(14, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[A persistent cough warrants assessment, but symptoms alone do not confirm TB.]

#sol-item(15, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Safe water, sanitation and hygiene can reduce transmission of some infections.]

#sol-item(16, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[ART treats HIV and can suppress viral load but does not cure the infection.]

#sol-item(17, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Vaccines target specific agents, and their protection varies by vaccine and individual factors.]

#sol-item(18, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[These are major noncommunicable disease categories.]

#sol-item(19, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Risk is not certainty and does not establish an individual diagnosis.]

#sol-item(20, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[General study material cannot replace individual clinical decisions.]

#sol-item(21, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Immediate danger requires urgent support and attention to safety.]

#sol-item(22, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[A live electrical source can injure the responder; disconnect safely and seek help.]

#sol-item(23, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Breathing should be monitored, and emergency guidance followed.]

#sol-item(24, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[An AED provides prompts during a suspected cardiac emergency.]

#sol-item(25, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Removing an embedded object can worsen bleeding; seek urgent help.]

#sol-item(26, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Cool the burn with running water while preventing the person from becoming cold.]

#sol-item(27, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Unnecessary movement can worsen injury; follow dispatcher guidance and move only when necessary.]

#sol-item(28, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Consent must be voluntary and can be withdrawn.]

#sol-item(29, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Unwanted contact is not the person's fault; safety and support matter.]

#sol-item(30, "A", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Condoms can reduce both pregnancy and many STI risks; most other contraceptives do not protect against STIs.]

#sol-item(31, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Some STIs have no obvious symptoms, so testing and advice may be important.]

#sol-item(32, "C", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Clean equipment and separation reduce cross-contamination.]

#sol-item(33, "D", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Unsafe handling can recontaminate treated water.]

#sol-item(34, "B", dense: true, pad: 3pt)[Resources and access shape the ability to act on advice.]

